To Run ExamGrader program => examgraderRun
    Expects a SolutionKeys.pdf and StudentAnswers.pdf

Number of Questions Option => --questions ##
    Assumes 55 questions with 50 questions 5 Extra Credit
    Defaults include 100 Questions 10 Extra Credit [--questions 110]
    and 110 Questions 10 Extra Credit [--questions 120]

Rerun Bad Files => --rerun-bad
    If there are files in BadSheets you can rerun them
    this will prompt you to fix their issues. Onced
    fixed it will be added to the rest of the reports
    and graded.

Run Late Answer Sheet => --add-late [filename]
    Run a new answer sheet adding it to the current list of 
    reports and grades. 